@startuml ref-state
!include _style.puml
title State - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
class Context {
  +request()
}
interface State {
  +handle()
}
class ConcreteStateA {
  +handle()
}
class ConcreteStateB {
  +handle()
}
Context o--> "state" State
State <|.. ConcreteStateA
State <|.. ConcreteStateB
note bottom of Context : Delegates to current State;\nbehavior changes with state
@enduml
